ghostty-vt (MIT) binds libghostty-vt (MIT), the terminal emulation library
from Ghostty: https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty

Overlay binaries are built from the signed libghostty-vt release tarballs
(see include/PROVENANCE.md). They statically include:

  simdutf          Apache-2.0 OR MIT
  Google Highway   Apache-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause
  Wuffs            Apache-2.0 OR MIT
  uucode           MIT (Unicode data: Unicode-3.0)

native/ghostty-vt-cl.c (the struct-by-value shim) is part of this repo (MIT).
